; onehotc_single_row_penalty_overflow: the column mirror of
; onehotr_single_column_penalty_overflow. A 1x2 grid gives ONEHOTC exactly
; one row, so the pair loop never runs and only the hoisted factor can
; raise.

PUSH 2
BQMX r0

PUSH 1                     ; rows
PUSH 2                     ; cols
RESIZE r0

PUSH 0                     ; col
PUSH 4611686018427387904   ; penalty
ONEHOTC r0
HALT
